  pSDRemoveMatte: 0
  userData: '{"key": "GreenSummonHammer", "label": "GreenSummon \u72ec\u7acb\u843d\u9524", "owner": "GreenSummon", "loop": false, "fps": 16, "duration": 0, "sort": 12, "action": "Effect: a single SUMMONED SPECTRAL JADE HAMMER FALL AND IMPACT, 16-frame one shot. Only an ethereal jade-green/gold hammer prop and impact energy, absolutely NO person, hand, banner or armor. Shape matches a massive jade/gold rectangular hammer head with a large green diamond inset and a short visible dark-green shaft. F1-3 faint spectral hammer materializes high near cell-local top; F4-7 drops vertically to cell-local impact anchor near bottom at y=210, same hammer scale; F8-10 strikes with a compact jade/gold flare and horizontal elliptical ground ripple; F11-15 hammer dissolves and ripple expands/fades; F16 only the last small fading glints near impact anchor. Keep all hammer, flare and ripple inside the cell with padding, no stone floor or scenery. Impact anchor fixed at same x and y, no camera movement."}'
